  "description": "Can we survive a 2nd pandemic?  \nWhen Jaehyun notices a bizarre phenomenon, he is rather dismissive of it. That is, until he discovers that his own long-term girlfriend Seoeun is suffering the same affliction. What in the world is going on, and why is everyone so desperate to eat plastic, at the expense of their very lives?\n\n[Original Novel](https://ridibooks.com/books/4647000007)  \n[Official English](https://manta.net/en/series/homo-plastikos?seriesId=2436)",
